ent of the temporary directory path\n\nlibfuse is built with debug info, so the random mktemp path ends up in\nlibfuse3.a and, through static linking, in the runtime's debug info,\nbuild ID and .gnu_debuglink CRC. Two builds of the same build\nenvironment therefore yield different runtime binaries.\n\nMap the path to a fixed one using -ffile-prefix-map. With this change,\nseparate builds produce bit-identical runtime and .debug files (tested\nfor x86_64 and i686).\n\nRefs #133","timestamp":"2026-10-19T20:35:22Z","author":{"name":"f321x","email":"f@f321x.com"},"committer":{"name":"TheAssassin","email":"theassassin@assassinate-you.net"}},"repository":{"id":536952188,"node_id":"R_kgDOIAE9fA","name":"type2-runtime","full_name":"AppImage/type2-runtime","private":false,"owner":{"login":"AppImage","id":16617932,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjE2NjE3OTMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16617932?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AppImage","html_url":"https://github.com/AppImage","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AppImage/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AppImage/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AppImage/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AppImage/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AppImage/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AppImage/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AppImage/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AppImage/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AppImage/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"html_url":"https://github.com/AppImage/type2-runtime","description":"The runtime is the executable part of every AppImage. It mounts the payload via FUSE and executes the entrypoint.","fork":false,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AppImage/type2-runtime","forks